@locale en
---

welcome.tourRecipesTitle = Recipes

welcome.tourRecipesBody = The shared cookbook. Browse and cook what every household has added, and add your own: import recipes from photos, web pages, or pasted text instead of typing them.

welcome.tourCollectionsTitle = Collections

welcome.tourCollectionsBody = Group recipes however you like: a weeknight set, a holiday menu, everything from one book. Collections can be shared with other households by link.

welcome.tourCollectionsFallback = On a phone, Collections lives in this menu.

welcome.tourAssistantTitle = Assistant

welcome.tourAssistantBody = A chat that helps with the tedious parts: finding, importing, and reworking recipes. Everything it proposes is staged for your review before it touches anything.

welcome.tourAssistantFallback = On a phone, the Assistant lives in this menu.

welcome.tourPantryTitle = Pantry

welcome.tourPantryBody = What's in your kitchen. The pantry powers the "ready to make" filter, tells recipes what you already have, and warns you before things expire.

welcome.tourScanTitle = Scan

welcome.tourScanBody = The barcode scanner. Point your camera at your groceries as you unpack them and they land in the pantry, with the name and package size filled in for you.

welcome.tourPlanTitle = Plan

welcome.tourPlanBody = What you intend to cook. Planning a meal puts its missing ingredients on the shopping list, and cooking it updates the pantry.

welcome.tourShoppingTitle = Shopping List

welcome.tourShoppingBody = Worked out for you: whatever your plan needs that the pantry can't cover. Tick items off as you buy them and they land straight in the pantry.

welcome.tourCatalogsTitle = Ingredients, Stores & Tools

welcome.tourCatalogsBody = Shared reference catalogs. Record what things cost where, and which kitchen tools you own; that's what powers cost estimates and the "ready to make" filter.

welcome.tourCatalogsFallback = On a phone, these catalogs live in this menu.

welcome.tourDocsTitle = The Guide

welcome.tourDocsBody = Full documentation for everything you just saw, whenever you need the details.

welcome.tourDocsFallback = On a phone, the guide lives in this menu.

welcome.tourHouseholdTitle = Your Household

welcome.tourHouseholdBody = The people you cook with: members, invites, and settings. Everything you've just seen is shared with them. Next up: create your household or join one with an invite.

welcome.heading = Welcome to Foodex

welcome.tourIntro = A one-minute tour of what's what.

welcome.getStarted = Get started
